	(text "MCU sheet notes"
		(at 25.4 213.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "001fa767-dabb-484e-a240-e0df52a99b65")
	)
	(text "Straps: IO0 = 1 via R102 10k PU (SPI boot; BOOT SW102 / Q202 pull low for download). IO2 (BOOST_EN) = 0 via R107 100k PD. IO12 (AMP_PDN) = 0 via R108 100k PD (3.3 V flash). IO15 (LCD_DC) internal PU, leave."
		(at 25.4 220.98 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a672a7ae-68f4-4ab7-a751-0bc102c06ac5")
	)
	(text "EN: R101 10k x C103 1uF = 10 ms RC delay. SW101 RESET to GND; Q201 (usb_uart) pulls ESP_EN low for auto-reset."
		(at 25.4 226.06 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bfec60ff-03dc-4a53-993e-83f296236cf3")
	)
	(text "I2C: R104/R105 2.2k to +3V3 are the only bus pull-ups; 400 kHz Fast-mode (t_r ~186 ns at ~100 pF)."
		(at 25.4 231.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5a0e8859-3e37-4035-b82c-6512e2edb235")
	)
	(text "I2C bus map (7-bit): 0x22/0x23 CH224Q, 0x2C/0x2D TAS5805M amps (L/R), 0x6B BQ2579x charger."
		(at 25.4 236.22 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "aad87081-2b5d-4a38-a6e9-404b0819c8d4")
	)
	(text "AMP_FAULT is ACTIVE-HIGH: Q102+Q101 (2N7002) in series form a NAND of AMPL/AMPR_FAULT_N; R109 100k PU. 1 = fault in either amp. Ignore until both amps configured (reg 0x61=0x0B, 0x60=0x01)."
		(at 25.4 241.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "75d0f559-05d9-491a-a54f-bfe96e7ab504")
	)
	(text "D101 status LED on IO0 (lit when IO0 low): drive GPIO0 open-drain only. R110-R118 33R source resistors; IOxx_R nets are local."
		(at 25.4 246.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0ae31be5-e5e1-48b7-83af-3c2ec9fe4800")
	)
	(text "U101 NC pins 17-22 (flash), 27/28 (GPIO16/17 PSRAM), 32 are not in the vendored symbol: leave unconnected. Pin 39 EPAD to GND."
		(at 25.4 251.46 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "59b4d44f-e271-46b4-9c22-8f52232963a9")
